config BR2_PACKAGE_THREAD_RELAY
	bool "thread-relay"
	help
	  thread-relay gives the Spinel stream of the IEEE 802.15.4 RCP
	  (/dev/esp_rcp0) to one TCP client: otbr-agent of the OpenThread
	  Border Router app of Home Assistant, with network_device.
	  thread-start runs it in place of ot-daemon when
	  /etc/default/thread says THREAD_MODE=relay.
